% holding-blocked: This original is licence-safe and fully notated, but it has not been tried with children. An SK classroom trial, an early-years music teacher, a Trinidadian steelpan educator and a second score reader must check the bells-in-the-gap partner answer, the framing of steelpan and Lord Kitchener, and the release details of the linked recording (an auto-generated upload of a 2009 Charlie's Records compilation; the original 1987 issue is not yet identified).
